@TestTamLy.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5296

### Health check
GET {{TestTamLy.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### Me (cần token)
GET {{TestTamLy.Api_HostAddress}}/api/me
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{idToken}}

### Firestore ping (cần token)
POST {{TestTamLy.Api_HostAddress}}/api/firestore/ping
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{idToken}}
